{"id":"prato","lemma":"prato","pos":"noun","rank":3419,"glosses":["grass, lawn (ground covered with grass kept closely mown)","meadow"],"ipa":"/ˈpra.to/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"prati"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-prato.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vai ad annaffiare il prato.","en":"Go water the lawn.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"andare"},null,{"g":"to water by sprinkling…"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Odio tosare il prato.","en":"I hate mowing the lawn.","words":[{"g":"hatred"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Il prato ha bisogno di essere innaffiato.","en":"The lawn needs to be watered.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avere"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"of"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Il suo cane stava correndo nel prato.","en":"His dog was running in the yard.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"his, hers, its"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"to stay, remain","l":"stare"},{"g":"to run [auxiliary…","l":"correre"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Vada ad annaffiare il prato.","en":"Go water the lawn.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"andare"},null,{"g":"to water by sprinkling…"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}